### GET published events sorted by startDate
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events?$filter=status eq 'Published'&$orderby=startDate


### GET events filtered by type Workshop
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events?$filter=eventType eq 'Workshop'


### GET all registrations for a specific event
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Registrations?$filter=eventId eq 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201


### POST a new registration
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201",
  "attendeeName": "New User",
  "attendeeEmail": "newuser@gmail.com",
  "attendeePhone": "9222222222",
  "company": "Infosys",
  "ticketType": "General",
  "registrationDate": "2026-06-01",
  "amountPaid": 500,
  "paymentId": "PAY011"
}


### GET speakers sorted by rating desc
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Speakers?$orderby=rating desc


### GET events with available seats
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events?$filter=registeredCount lt maxAttendees


### PATCH event status from Draft to Published
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events(ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000202)
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Published"
}


### POST feedback for an event
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201",
  "attendeeEmail": "newuser@gmail.com",
  "overallRating": 5,
  "contentRating": 5,
  "venueRating": 4,
  "speakerRating": 5,
  "comment": "Very useful event",
  "submittedAt": "2026-06-10T18:00:00Z"
}


### GET registrations filtered by ticket type General
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Registrations?$filter=ticketType eq 'General'


### GET events sorted by ticket price descending
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events?$orderby=ticketPrice desc


### GET only specific fields for events
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events?$select=title,eventType,status,startDate


### Get top 3 speakers 
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Speakers?$top=3


### GET total count of events
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/event/Events/$count